{
  "changelog": "Initial release: Automates the creation and export of thematic maps.\n\n- Generates choropleth, proportional symbol, and dot density maps from local geospatial data or synthetic data.\n- Supports three statistical classification methods: equal interval, quantile, and Jenks natural breaks.\n- Outputs maps as PNG, vector PDF, and GeoJSON (with class field), plus optional TIFF and metadata JSON.\n- Command-line interface allows fine control of data source, map type, classification, appearance, and output.\n- All processing is performed locally; requires no internet connection and preserves user privacy.",
